  // Nördlingen, 5–6 September 1634 (short card, 2026-10-27). Schiller,
  // Geschichte des dreißigjährigen Kriegs, ch. 18 (Projekt Gutenberg): the
  // king of Hungary given the command with Gallas actually leading, the
