  // The Peace of Prague, 30 May 1635 (title the user's, 2026-10-27; opening
  // line the user's, kept from the Nördlingen card). Signed at Prague Castle
  // after preliminaries at Pirna (Nov 1634). Terms (en.wikipedia): no
